    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen of treasure isle is a simple, small-scale metroidvania that mainly consists of bomb throwing and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can retrieve the treasure hidden in various places and return home in a balloon when you are done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some strong queens waiting for you on the island, but you don't have to fight them. If you are not confident, avoid them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribution Terms and Conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We permit both individuals and corporations to distribute and monetize gameplay videos as long as you include the name of the game and the URL of the store page in the summary section, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen of treasure isle is a simple, small-scale metroidvania that mainly consists of bomb throwing and jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can retrieve the treasure hidden in various places and return home in a balloon when you are done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some strong queens waiting for you on the island, but you don't have to fight them. If you are not confident, avoid them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribution Terms and Conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We permit both individuals and corporations to distribute and monetize gameplay videos as long as you include the name of the game and the URL of the store page in the summary section, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
